:"Organisieren und planen","de_DE_formal":"Organisieren und planen","es_ES":"Organizar y planificar","fr_FR":"Organiser et planifier","it_IT":"Organizzare e pianificare"},"value":"organise","media":{"kind":"lucide","value":"clipboard-list"}}],"props":{"multiple":true,"layout":{"desktop":"grid","mobile":"grid"},"hideIcons":false,"columns":{"desktop":4,"mobile":2}}}]},{"id":"contact","type":"contact","title":{"en_US":"Almost done! How can we reach you?","de_DE":"Fast geschafft! Wie erreichen wir dich?","de_DE_formal":"Fast geschafft! Wie erreichen wir Sie?","es_ES":"¡Casi listo! ¿Cómo podemos contactarte?","fr_FR":"Presque terminé ! Comment vous joindre ?","it_IT":"Quasi fatto! Come possiamo contattarti?"},"description":{"en_US":"No cover letter, no CV. We will call you within a few days. Your details are only used for your request and never passed on.","de_DE":"Kein Anschreiben, kein Lebenslauf. Wir rufen dich innerhalb weniger Tage an. Deine Angaben nutzen wir nur für deine Anfrage und geben sie nicht weiter.","de_DE_formal":"Kein Anschreiben, kein Lebenslauf. Wir rufen Sie innerhalb weniger Tage an. Ihre Angaben nutzen wir nur für Ihre Anfrage und geben sie nicht weiter.","es_ES":"Sin carta ni CV. Te llamaremos en pocos días. Solo usamos tus datos para tu solicitud y nunca los cedemos.","fr_FR":"Ni lettre ni CV. Nous vous appelons sous quelques jours. Vos données servent uniquement à votre demande et ne sont jamais transmises.","it_IT":"Niente lettera né CV. Ti chiameremo entro pochi giorni. Usiamo i tuoi dati solo per la tua richiesta e non li cediamo mai."},"submitLabel":{"en_US":"Send application","de_DE":"Bewerbung absenden","de_DE_formal":"Bewerbung absenden","es_ES":"Enviar candidatura","fr_FR":"Envoyer ma candidature","it_IT":"Invia candidatura"},"fields":[{"id":"c_name","type":"name","key":"name","label":{"en_US":"Name","de_DE":"Name","de_DE_formal":"Name","es_ES":"Nombre","fr_FR":"Nom","it_IT":"Nome"},"required":true,"props":{"placeholder":{"en_US":"Jane Smith","de_DE":"Max Mustermann","de_DE_formal":"Max Mustermann","es_ES":"Ana García","fr_FR":"Marie Dupont","it_IT":"Mario Rossi"},"icon":"lucide:user"}},{"id":"c_email","type":"email","key":"email","label":{"en_US":"E-mail address","de_DE":"E-Mail-Adresse","de_DE_formal":"E-Mail-Adresse","es_ES":"Correo electrónico","fr_FR":"Adresse e-mail","it_IT":"Indirizzo e-mail"},"required":true,"props":{"placeholder":{"en_US":"name@example.com","de_DE":"name@beispiel.de","de_DE_formal":"name@beispiel.de","es_ES":"nombre@ejemplo.com","fr_FR":"nom@exemple.fr","it_IT":"nome@esempio.it"},"b2bOnly":false,"icon":"lucide:mail"}},{"id":"c_phone","type":"phone","key":"phone","label":{"en_US":"Phone number","de_DE":"Telefonnummer","de_DE_formal":"Telefonnummer","es_ES":"Teléfono","fr_FR":"Numéro de téléphone","it_IT":"Numero di telefono"},"required":true,"props":{"placeholder":{"en_US":"For questions about your request","de_DE":"Für Rückfragen zu deiner Anfrage","de_DE_formal":"Für Rückfragen zu Ihrer Anfrage","es_ES":"Para dudas sobre tu solicitud","fr_FR":"Pour toute question sur votre demande","it_IT":"Per domande sulla tua richiesta"},"icon":"lucide:phone"}},{"id":"c_consent","type":"consent","key":"consent","label":{"en_US":"","de_DE":"","de_DE_formal":"","es_ES":"","fr_FR":"","it_IT":""},"required":true,"props":{"html":{"en_US":"I agree that my details are used to process my application. More in the <a href=\"%privacy_url%\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">privacy policy</a>.","de_DE":"Ich bin einverstanden, dass meine Angaben zur Bearbeitung meiner Bewerbung verwendet werden. Mehr dazu in der <a href=\"%privacy_url%\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Datenschutzerklärung</a>.","de_DE_formal":"Ich bin einverstanden, dass meine Angaben zur Bearbeitung meiner Bewerbung verwendet werden. Mehr dazu in der <a href=\"%privacy_url%\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Datenschutzerklärung</a>.","es_ES":"Acepto que mis datos se utilicen para tramitar mi candidatura. Más información en la <a href=\"%privacy_url%\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">política de privacidad</a>.","fr_FR":"J’accepte que mes données soient utilisées pour traiter ma candidature. Plus d’informations dans la <a href=\"%privacy_url%\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">politique de confidentialité</a>.","it_IT":"Acconsento all’uso dei miei dati per valutare la mia candidatura. Maggiori informazioni nell’<a href=\"%privacy_url%\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">informativa sulla privacy</a>."}}}],"showBottomBar":true,"layout":{"columns":{"desktop":2,"mobile":1}}},{"id":"end","type":"end","success":{"show":true,"heading":{"en_US":"Thank you, {{field:name}}!","de_DE":"Vielen Dank, {{field:name}}!","de_DE_formal":"Vielen Dank, {{field:name}}!","es_ES":"¡Gracias, {{field:name}}!","fr_FR":"Merci, {{field:name}} !","it_IT":"Grazie, {{field:name}}!"},"text":{"en_US":"<p>Your application has arrived. We will read it carefully and get back to you within a few days.</p><h3>What happens now?</h3><ol><li>We read your answers.</li><li>We call you within a few days.</li><li>You get to know us on a trial day.</li></ol>","de_DE":"<p>Deine Bewerbung ist bei uns angekommen. Wir sehen sie uns genau an und melden uns innerhalb weniger Tage.</p><h3>Was passiert jetzt?</h3><ol><li>Wir lesen deine Angaben.</li><li>Wir rufen dich innerhalb weniger Tage an.</li><li>An einem Probetag lernst du uns kennen.</li></ol>","de_DE_formal":"<p>Ihre Bewerbung ist bei uns angekommen. Wir sehen sie uns genau an und melden uns innerhalb weniger Tage.</p><h3>Was passiert jetzt?</h3><ol><li>Wir lesen Ihre Angaben.</li><li>Wir rufen Sie innerhalb weniger Tage an.</li><li>An einem Probetag lernen Sie uns kennen.</li></ol>","es_ES":"<p>Hemos recibido tu candidatura. La revisaremos con atención y te responderemos en pocos días.</p><h3>¿Qué pasa ahora?</h3><ol><li>Leemos tus respuestas.</li><li>Te llamamos en pocos días.</li><li>Nos conoces en un día de prueba.</li></ol>","fr_FR":"<p>Votre candidature nous est bien parvenue. Nous l’étudions avec attention et revenons vers vous sous quelques jours.</p><h3>Et maintenant ?</h3><ol><li>Nous lisons vos réponses.</li><li>Nous vous appelons sous quelques jours.</li><li>Vous faites notre connaissance lors d’une journée d’essai.</li></ol>","it_IT":"<p>Abbiamo ricevuto la tua candidatura. La valuteremo con attenzione e ti risponderemo entro pochi giorni.</p><h3>E adesso?</h3><ol><li>Leggiamo le tue risposte.</li><li>Ti chiamiamo entro pochi giorni.</li><li>Ci conosci in una giornata di prova.</li></ol>"},"animation":"confetti","button":{"label":{"en_US":"Back to the website","de_DE":"Zurück zur Website","de_DE_formal":"Zurück zur Website","es_ES":"Volver a la web","fr_FR":"Retour au site","it_IT":"Torna al sito"},"url":{"en_US":"%home_url%","de_DE":"%home_url%","de_DE_formal":"%home_url%","es_ES":"%home_url%","fr_FR":"%home_url%","it_IT":"%home_url%"}}},"redirect":null}],"edges":[{"id":"e_job_1","from":"job","to":"school","default":true},{"id":"e_school_1","from":"school","to":"start","default":true},{"id":"e_start_1","from":"start","to":"likes","default":true},{"id":"e_likes_1","from":"likes","to":"contact","default":true},{"id":"e_contact_1","from":"contact","to":"end","default":true}],"calculations":[],"actions":[{"id":"a_owner","on":"submit","kind":"email","config":{"to":{"en_US":"","de_DE":"","de_DE_formal":"","es_ES":"","fr_FR":"","it_IT":""},"cc":{"en_US":"","de_DE":"","de_DE_formal":"","es_ES":"","fr_FR":"","it_IT":""},"bcc":{"en_US":"","de_DE":"","de_DE_formal":"","es_ES":"","fr_FR":"","it_IT":""},"from":{"en_US":"","de_DE":"","de_DE_formal":"","es_ES":"","fr_FR":"","it_IT":""},"fromName":{"en_US":"","de_DE":"","de_DE_formal":"","es_ES":"","fr_FR":"","it_IT":""},"replyTo":{"en_US":"{{field:email}}","de_DE":"{{field:email}}","de_DE_formal":"{{field:email}}","es_ES":"{{field:email}}","fr_FR":"{{field:email}}","it_IT":"{{field:email}}"},"subject":{"en_US":"New apprenticeship application: {{field:job}} · {{field:school}} · {{fiel